// Triage + D-099: the hint on a repeated failure is asked of a fork of the agent's own context,
// so it reads the whole conversation instead of an excerpt. Needs an engine profile with
// cacheReadOnly and cachedTokens (dylanbrodiefafard/ninfer). Compare against `triage` on the
// error-recovery tasks: success, repeated-failure runs, and whether hinted failures cleared.
{
	"modules": {
		"triage": { "enabled": true, "forkHints": true }
	}
}
